---
description: Core project workflow for every agent task
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `/AGENTS.md`, including the definition of done.

Before editing code:

1. Read the applicable design under `/docs/architecture/`.
2. Read `/docs/constitutions/index.md`.
3. Read only the constitutions for libraries involved in the task.
4. Prefer an existing recipe under `/docs/recipes/` when the task matches one.

Do not load unrelated constitutions. Do not invent patterns when a recipe or Overview example already exists.
